  dialogueLines:
  - Surely something will happen if the player keeps pressing it.
  - The player keeps pressing the button. Something must happen eventually.
  - Perhaps the button will do something if the player presses it enough times.
  - "The player seems determined to press it. Surely it can\u2019t stay useless forever."
